238                 case when not missing(daily_date) and not missing(daily_age)
16                                                         The SAS System                     Tuesday, November  3, 2026 06:46:00 AM

239                           and not missing(price_tol) and not missing(daily_gap)
240                           and daily_rows=1 and daily_ccy_n=1 and not missing(daily_cur)
241                           and daily_gap<=price_tol and daily_age>=0 and daily_age<=7
242                           and market_days_gap=0
